WEBVTT

00:02.509 --> 00:04.135
KATARA: Water...

00:04.886 --> 00:06.095
Earth...

00:06.679 --> 00:08.348
Fire...

00:08.890 --> 00:10.308
Air.

00:11.351 --> 00:15.021
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.396 --> 00:18.608
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.484 --> 00:22.570
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.654 --> 00:23.780
could stop them.

00:23.863 --> 00:25.573
But when the world
needed him most,

00:25.657 --> 00:26.824
he vanished.

00:27.367 --> 00:28.409
100 years passed,

00:28.493 --> 00:31.120
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar―

00:31.204 --> 00:32.789
An airbender named Aang.

00:32.956 --> 00:35.083
And although his airbending
skills are great,

00:35.166 --> 00:37.877
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.961 --> 00:38.962
AANG: Oof.

00:39.045 --> 00:42.173
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:50.473 --> 00:53.851
Even though I was born blind,
I've never had a problem seeing.

00:53.935 --> 00:55.645
I see with earthbending.

00:56.229 --> 00:57.730
Look here, sugar queen,

00:57.814 --> 00:59.399
I gave up everything I had

00:59.482 --> 01:01.609
so that I could
teach Aang earthbending.

01:07.240 --> 01:08.741
Well, look at this.

01:09.409 --> 01:12.537
Enemies and traitors
all working together.

01:14.372 --> 01:15.415
Aah!

01:30.597 --> 01:32.056
Today's the day.

01:32.140 --> 01:33.266
Can you believe it?

01:33.349 --> 01:35.518
After all that time
searching for a teacher,

01:35.602 --> 01:37.895
I'm finally
starting earthbending.

01:38.021 --> 01:39.647
And this place,
it's perfect.

01:39.772 --> 01:41.107
Don't you think?

01:41.482 --> 01:42.483
Sokka?

01:43.276 --> 01:44.277
( GROWLS )

01:44.360 --> 01:45.862
Oh, you're still sleeping, huh?

01:48.531 --> 01:49.616
( WHISPERS ) Sorry.

01:51.951 --> 01:54.787
Good morning, earthbending student.

01:55.788 --> 01:57.332
Good morning, Sifu Toph.

01:57.540 --> 02:00.460
Hey, you never call me
Sifu Katara.

02:00.543 --> 02:02.545
Well, if you think I should.

02:02.629 --> 02:03.630
( SOKKA GROWLS )

02:04.255 --> 02:05.381
Sorry, snoozles.

02:05.506 --> 02:08.384
We'll do our earthbending
as quietly as we can.

02:10.136 --> 02:13.264
Aah!

02:14.599 --> 02:15.933
( GRUMBLING EXCITEDLY )

02:17.060 --> 02:18.895
Running around
and making noises

02:18.978 --> 02:21.147
and Sokka's trying to sleep.

02:22.065 --> 02:24.025
So what move are you gonna
teach me first?

02:24.108 --> 02:26.402
Rockalanche, the trembler?

02:26.611 --> 02:29.614
Oh, maybe I can learn to make a whirlpool
out of land.

02:29.906 --> 02:33.242
Well, let's start with, move a rock.

02:33.785 --> 02:35.286
Sounds good. Sounds good.

02:36.579 --> 02:39.582
The key to earthbending
is your stance.

02:39.666 --> 02:42.126
You've got to be
steady and strong.

02:42.210 --> 02:44.045
Rock is a stubborn element.

02:44.128 --> 02:45.505
If you're going to move it,

02:45.588 --> 02:47.840
you've got to be like a rock yourself.

02:47.965 --> 02:49.509
Like a rock. Got it.

02:49.592 --> 02:50.593
Good.

02:50.677 --> 02:53.304
Now, the actual motion of
this one is pretty simple.

02:57.809 --> 03:00.019
Ok, you ready to give it a try?

03:00.436 --> 03:01.437
I'm ready.

03:03.398 --> 03:05.942
Aah! Uh!

03:06.401 --> 03:07.735
SOKKA: Rock beats airbender.

03:12.573 --> 03:14.367
Ha ha! I got you, dad.

03:15.159 --> 03:17.495
No! Ha ha.

03:17.578 --> 03:18.996
( LAUGHTER )

03:23.376 --> 03:25.586
My beloved Lu Ten,

03:26.045 --> 03:27.547
I will see you again.

03:29.757 --> 03:30.758
ZUKO: Uncle.

03:31.467 --> 03:32.969
You were unconscious.

03:33.970 --> 03:35.138
Azula did this to you.

03:35.847 --> 03:37.598
It was a surprise attack.

03:37.724 --> 03:40.643
Somehow that's not so surprising.

03:43.604 --> 03:45.565
I hope I made it
the way you like it.

03:48.484 --> 03:49.777
( DEADPAN ) Good.

03:50.862 --> 03:51.863
( GAGS )

03:51.946 --> 03:55.742
That was very, um, bracing.

03:58.161 --> 04:00.163
So, uncle, I've been thinking.

04:00.246 --> 04:01.622
It's only a matter of time

04:01.706 --> 04:03.166
before I run into Azula again.

04:03.332 --> 04:05.752
I'm going to need to know more
advanced firebending

04:05.835 --> 04:07.712
if I want to stand a chance
against her.

04:07.795 --> 04:08.921
I know what you'll say.

04:09.005 --> 04:11.758
She's my sister. I should be
trying to get along with her.

04:11.841 --> 04:15.678
No. She's crazy,
and she needs to go down.

04:22.935 --> 04:25.354
It's time to resume your training.

04:25.980 --> 04:27.607
I don't understand
what went wrong.

04:27.690 --> 04:29.442
He did it exactly the way you did.

04:29.525 --> 04:30.777
Maybe there's another way.

04:31.235 --> 04:33.738
What if I came at the boulder
from a different angle?

04:33.821 --> 04:35.198
No, that's the problem.

04:35.281 --> 04:37.450
You've got to stop thinking
like an airbender.

04:37.784 --> 04:40.077
There's no different angle,
no clever solution,

04:40.161 --> 04:42.705
no trickity-trick
that's gonna move that rock.

04:42.997 --> 04:45.082
You've got
to face it head-on.

04:45.166 --> 04:48.461
And when I say head-on,
I mean like this.

04:48.795 --> 04:49.796
Hyah!

04:50.546 --> 04:51.547
Whoa.

04:54.050 --> 04:56.427
I've been training Aang
for a while now.

04:56.511 --> 04:59.597
He really responds well to a positive
teaching experience―

04:59.972 --> 05:01.849
Lots of encouragement
and praise,

05:02.183 --> 05:04.519
Kind words. If he's
doing something wrong,

05:04.602 --> 05:07.605
maybe a gentle nudge
in the right direction.

05:07.939 --> 05:11.609
Thanks, Katara.
A gentle nudge. I'll try that.

05:12.193 --> 05:14.487
Keep your knees high,
twinkle toes.

05:34.882 --> 05:35.967
Rock collide.

05:59.490 --> 06:00.491
Huh?

06:21.596 --> 06:22.805
Rock collide.

06:34.609 --> 06:36.110
You're awfully cute,

06:36.319 --> 06:39.155
But unfortunately for you,
you're made of meat.

06:40.364 --> 06:42.450
Just a bit closer.

06:42.533 --> 06:45.369
( YELLING )

06:50.207 --> 06:51.250
Gotcha.

06:55.046 --> 06:58.299
You are one lucky
little meat creature.

07:00.801 --> 07:04.055
Lightning is
a pure expression of firebending―

07:04.138 --> 07:05.514
Without aggression.

07:05.598 --> 07:08.059
It is not fueled by rage or emotion

07:08.142 --> 07:09.644
the way other firebending is.

07:10.394 --> 07:13.064
Some call lightning
the cold-blooded fire.

07:13.814 --> 07:16.734
It is precise and deadly, like Azula.

07:17.234 --> 07:19.236
To perform the technique requires

07:19.320 --> 07:20.696
peace of mind.

07:20.905 --> 07:23.866
I see. That's why we're drinking tea―

07:24.659 --> 07:25.952
To calm the mind.

07:26.035 --> 07:27.620
Oh, yeah, good point!

07:28.245 --> 07:29.705
( SLOWLY ) I mean, yes.

07:30.581 --> 07:32.375
There is energy all around us.

07:32.875 --> 07:35.920
The energy is both Yin and Yang―

07:36.253 --> 07:39.173
A positive energy and a negative energy.

07:39.256 --> 07:42.885
Only a select few firebenders
can separate these energies.

07:43.552 --> 07:45.554
This creates an imbalance.

07:45.638 --> 07:48.349
The energy wants to restore balance.

07:48.432 --> 07:51.477
And in the moment
the positive and negative energy

07:51.560 --> 07:53.479
come crashing back together,

07:53.562 --> 07:56.565
You provide release and guidance,

07:56.649 --> 07:58.234
creating lightning.

08:12.123 --> 08:13.290
I'm ready to try it.

08:14.792 --> 08:16.919
Remember, once you separate the energy,

08:17.003 --> 08:18.546
you do not command it.

08:18.629 --> 08:20.673
You are simply its humble guide.

08:21.132 --> 08:22.258
Breathe first.

08:22.633 --> 08:24.010
( INHALES )

08:30.641 --> 08:32.560
Hyah! Uh!

08:37.898 --> 08:40.985
TOPH: This time, we're going to
try something a little different.

08:41.068 --> 08:44.447
Instead of moving a rock,
we're going to stop a rock.

08:44.780 --> 08:46.323
Get in your horse stance.

08:47.992 --> 08:50.202
I'm going to roll that boulder
down at you.

08:50.619 --> 08:52.621
If you have the attitude
of an earthbender,

08:53.080 --> 08:56.000
you'll stay in your stance
and stop the rock,

08:56.625 --> 08:58.085
Like this.

08:58.461 --> 09:00.046
Sorry, Toph, but are you sure

09:00.129 --> 09:02.798
this is really the best way
to teach Aang earthbending?

09:03.174 --> 09:04.800
I'm glad you said something.

09:05.134 --> 09:06.844
Actually, there is a better way.

09:07.636 --> 09:09.430
This way, you'll really have to sense

09:09.513 --> 09:11.640
the vibrations
of the boulder to stop it.

09:12.183 --> 09:13.434
Thank you, Katara.

09:13.517 --> 09:15.269
( SARCASTICALLY )
Yeah, thanks, Katara.

09:15.561 --> 09:16.562
( CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY )

09:44.340 --> 09:45.925
I guess I just panicked.

09:46.008 --> 09:47.343
I don't know what to say.

09:47.676 --> 09:50.179
There's nothing to say.
You blew it.

09:50.262 --> 09:53.015
You had a perfect stance
and perfect form,

09:53.099 --> 09:54.725
but when it came right down to it,

09:54.809 --> 09:56.352
you didn't have the guts.

09:57.103 --> 09:58.771
I know. I'm sorry.

09:59.355 --> 10:00.689
Yeah, you are sorry.

10:00.898 --> 10:02.983
If you're not tough enough
to stop the rock,

10:03.067 --> 10:05.820
then you can at least
give it the pleasure of smushing you

10:05.903 --> 10:08.656
instead ofjumping out
of the way like a jelly-boned wimp.

10:09.073 --> 10:13.661
Now do you have what it takes
to face that rock like an earthbender?

10:14.870 --> 10:17.540
No, I don't think I do.

10:17.957 --> 10:19.208
Aang, it's no big deal.

10:19.291 --> 10:22.378
You'll take a break and try
earthbending again when you're ready.

10:22.461 --> 10:25.339
Besides, you still have
a lot of waterbending to work on, ok?

10:25.881 --> 10:27.842
Yeah, that sounds good.

10:29.426 --> 10:32.555
Yeah, whatever.
Go splash around until you feel better.

10:37.309 --> 10:38.602
Why can't I do it?

10:38.686 --> 10:41.147
Instead of lightning,
it keeps exploding in my face,

10:41.397 --> 10:43.023
like everything always does.

10:43.941 --> 10:45.734
I was afraid this might happen.

10:46.277 --> 10:48.529
You will not be able
to master lightning

10:48.612 --> 10:51.490
until you have dealt
with the turmoil inside you.

10:51.991 --> 10:53.117
What turmoil?

10:53.367 --> 10:56.579
Zuko, you must let go
of your feelings of shame

10:56.662 --> 10:58.747
if you want your anger to go away.

10:59.039 --> 11:00.749
But I don't feel any shame at all.

11:00.833 --> 11:02.001
I'm as proud as ever.

11:02.334 --> 11:05.546
Prince Zuko, pride is not
the opposite of shame,

11:05.629 --> 11:06.630
but its source.

11:07.006 --> 11:10.176
True humility is the only antidote
to shame.

11:10.259 --> 11:14.013
Well, my life has been nothing
but humbling lately.

11:15.431 --> 11:17.308
I have another idea.

11:17.641 --> 11:19.643
I will teach you
a firebending move

11:19.727 --> 11:21.437
that even Azula doesn't know,

11:21.687 --> 11:23.939
because I made it up myself.

11:28.611 --> 11:30.738
You probably think
I deserve this, don't you?

11:33.532 --> 11:34.950
Look, I'm sorry I hunted you,

11:35.034 --> 11:37.119
but that's just the natural
order of things.

11:37.203 --> 11:40.122
Big things eat smaller things.
Nothing personal.

11:40.206 --> 11:42.208
But this time,
it didn't work out that way.

11:42.541 --> 11:43.584
( CALLS )

11:44.210 --> 11:46.921
I admit it, you're cute.

11:48.923 --> 11:50.633
Ok, you convinced me.

11:51.050 --> 11:52.343
If I get out of this alive,

11:52.426 --> 11:55.512
it's a karmically correct
vegetarian existence for me.

11:55.721 --> 12:00.351
No meat, even though meat
is so tasty.

12:11.195 --> 12:13.906
Hey, it looks like my karma's
already paying off.

12:15.407 --> 12:16.825
That's ok. I got it.

12:21.455 --> 12:22.915
Now come back, boomerang.

12:25.626 --> 12:26.627
( CROAKING )

12:31.840 --> 12:34.760
You know this block you're having
is only temporary, right?

12:35.094 --> 12:36.553
I don't want to talk about it.

12:36.804 --> 12:39.139
You do realize
that's the problem, don't you?

12:39.556 --> 12:41.809
If you face this issue
instead of avoiding it...

12:41.892 --> 12:43.477
I know, I know, I know, I know.

12:43.560 --> 12:46.647
I get it, all right?
I need to face it head-on like a rock.

12:46.939 --> 12:48.440
But I just can't do it.

12:48.524 --> 12:50.359
I don't know why I can't, but I can't.

12:50.818 --> 12:53.195
Aang, if fire and water are opposites,

12:53.279 --> 12:55.072
Then what's the opposite of air?

12:55.322 --> 12:56.448
I guess it's earth.

12:56.699 --> 12:58.784
That's why it's so hard
for you to get this.

12:59.285 --> 13:01.287
You're working
with your natural opposite.

13:01.370 --> 13:02.579
But you'll figure it out.

13:02.663 --> 13:03.872
I know you will.

13:06.667 --> 13:07.668
Think fast.

13:10.629 --> 13:14.717
Excellent. You have the reflexes
of a waterbending master.

13:14.842 --> 13:18.512
Thanks, Katara, Sifu Katara.

13:22.516 --> 13:24.685
Fire is the element of power.

13:24.768 --> 13:27.688
The people of the Fire Nation
have desire and will

13:27.980 --> 13:30.399
and the energy and drive
to achieve what they want.

13:32.151 --> 13:34.778
Earth is the element of substance.

13:34.862 --> 13:36.572
The people of the Earth Kingdom

13:36.655 --> 13:38.240
are diverse and strong.

13:38.615 --> 13:40.909
They are persistent and enduring.

13:42.119 --> 13:44.496
Air is the element of freedom.

13:44.580 --> 13:47.249
The Air Nomads detached themselves

13:47.333 --> 13:49.335
from worldly concerns

13:49.626 --> 13:51.545
and found peace and freedom.

13:51.837 --> 13:53.547
Also, they apparently had

13:53.630 --> 13:55.924
pretty good senses of humor.

13:59.428 --> 14:02.181
Water is the element of change.

14:02.264 --> 14:04.058
The people of the Water Tribe

14:04.141 --> 14:07.227
are capable of adapting to many things.

14:07.644 --> 14:11.148
They have a deep sense
of community and love

14:11.357 --> 14:13.525
that holds them together
through anything.

14:14.860 --> 14:16.737
Why are you telling me these things?

14:17.321 --> 14:20.783
It is important to draw wisdom
from many different places.

14:21.116 --> 14:23.660
If we take it from only one place,

14:23.744 --> 14:26.121
it becomes rigid and stale.

14:26.205 --> 14:28.916
Understanding others―
The other elements

14:29.249 --> 14:30.959
and the other nations―

14:31.043 --> 14:32.920
will help you become whole.

14:33.670 --> 14:37.091
All this four elements talk
is sounding like Avatar stuff.

14:37.424 --> 14:40.677
It is the combination
of the four elements in one person

14:40.761 --> 14:43.305
that makes the Avatar so powerful,

14:43.639 --> 14:46.350
but it can make you more powerful, too.

14:46.600 --> 14:49.019
You see, the technique
I am about to teach you

14:49.103 --> 14:51.688
is one I learned
by studying the waterbenders.

15:00.864 --> 15:01.949
Aang...

15:02.032 --> 15:03.534
I found these nuts in your bag.

15:03.617 --> 15:05.160
I figured you wouldn't mind.

15:05.244 --> 15:07.037
And besides, even if you did,

15:07.121 --> 15:09.748
you're too much of a pushover
to do anything about it.

15:10.207 --> 15:12.334
As a matter of fact,
I don't mind.

15:12.418 --> 15:14.044
I'm happy to share
anything I have.

15:14.586 --> 15:16.922
You know, I'm really
glad you feel that way,

15:17.005 --> 15:20.134
Because I also have
this great new nutcracker.

15:23.679 --> 15:25.848
- Actually, I'd prefer if you didn't―
-( SMASH )

15:26.181 --> 15:28.350
That's an antique,
handcrafted by the monk―

15:29.143 --> 15:30.561
It's a delicate instrument.

15:30.978 --> 15:33.605
It's not the only
delicate instrument around here.

15:39.194 --> 15:41.572
Om.

15:41.989 --> 15:43.323
Hey, Aang, have you seen―

15:43.407 --> 15:44.450
Meditating here.

15:44.741 --> 15:46.493
It's important. It's almost sundown,

15:46.577 --> 15:48.328
and Sokka isn't back yet.

15:48.412 --> 15:49.997
I think we should search for him.

15:50.247 --> 15:52.249
We'll find him faster if we split up.

15:54.585 --> 15:56.670
Ok, karma person or thing,

15:56.753 --> 15:58.422
whoever's in charge of this stuff,

15:58.505 --> 16:01.091
if I can just
get out of this situation alive,

16:01.175 --> 16:05.429
I will give up meat and sarcasm, ok?

16:05.512 --> 16:08.223
Ow! That's all I got.

16:08.557 --> 16:10.434
That's pretty much my whole identity.

16:10.517 --> 16:13.061
Sokka, the meat and sarcasm guy.

16:13.145 --> 16:14.730
But I'm willing to be Sokka,

16:14.813 --> 16:16.607
the veggies and straight-talk fellow.

16:16.857 --> 16:17.858
Deal?

16:18.734 --> 16:19.735
Aang!

16:19.818 --> 16:21.820
Thank goodness.
Have you got any meat?

16:22.321 --> 16:24.198
Sokka, are you ok?

16:25.491 --> 16:28.285
Stop, stop!
You're gonna pull my fingers off.

16:28.368 --> 16:30.454
And I don't think
the rest of me is coming.

16:30.746 --> 16:33.874
Hmm, I bet I can airbend
you out of here.

16:40.464 --> 16:42.424
Seriously, Aang, I know you're new at it,

16:42.508 --> 16:45.177
but I could use a little
earthbending here. How about it?

16:46.512 --> 16:47.513
I can't.

16:47.596 --> 16:48.722
I can't do it.

16:55.854 --> 16:58.607
Well, if you can't earthbend me
out of here, go get Toph.

16:58.732 --> 16:59.983
I can't do that either.

17:00.400 --> 17:02.027
You can't? Why not?

17:02.444 --> 17:05.906
It would just be really... Uncomfortable.

17:06.114 --> 17:07.115
"Uncomfortable."

17:07.199 --> 17:09.535
Well, I wouldn't want you
to feel uncomfortable.

17:09.618 --> 17:10.786
Thanks, Sokka.

17:11.245 --> 17:14.289
This whole earthbending thing
really has me confused.

17:14.373 --> 17:15.999
There's so much pressure.

17:16.333 --> 17:18.335
Everyone expects me
to get it right away.

17:18.460 --> 17:21.046
It puts me in a really awkward position.

17:21.171 --> 17:23.382
Awkward position?
I think I know the feeling.

17:23.507 --> 17:25.384
If I try, I fail.

17:25.467 --> 17:28.595
But if I don't try,
I'm never gonna get it.

17:28.679 --> 17:31.265
I feel like I'm caught between
a rock and a hard place.

17:31.390 --> 17:33.058
Hmm, how about that?

17:33.767 --> 17:35.936
Aang, this is my friend,
Fufu Cuddly Poops.

17:36.019 --> 17:37.854
Fufu Cuddly Poops, Aang.

17:37.938 --> 17:41.525
Aw. What a cute name for a little baby
sabertooth moose lion cub.

17:41.984 --> 17:44.820
Really? He looks nothing like
a sabertooth moose lion.

17:44.903 --> 17:47.823
It's hard to tell before
their giant teeth and horns grow in.

17:48.073 --> 17:49.825
What you doing out here, little guy?

17:49.950 --> 17:51.118
Did you lose your mama?

17:52.494 --> 17:53.579
( ANIMAL GROWLING )

17:59.876 --> 18:02.504
Waterbenders deal
with the flow of energy.

18:03.130 --> 18:06.425
A waterbender lets their defense
become their offense,

18:06.508 --> 18:09.553
turning their opponent's
energy against them.

18:09.636 --> 18:12.139
I learned a way to do this with lightning.

18:12.222 --> 18:14.224
You can teach me to redirect lightning?

18:15.309 --> 18:18.353
If you let the energy
in your own body flow,

18:18.478 --> 18:20.105
The lightning will follow it.

18:20.188 --> 18:22.983
You must create a pathway
from your fingertips

18:23.066 --> 18:25.652
up your arm to your shoulder,

18:25.736 --> 18:27.738
then down into your stomach.

18:28.238 --> 18:31.074
The stomach is the source
of energy in your body.

18:31.533 --> 18:33.785
It is called the sea of chi,

18:34.745 --> 18:38.081
only in my case,
it is more like a vast ocean.

18:38.165 --> 18:39.958
( LAUGHING )

18:41.668 --> 18:46.715
From the stomach, you direct it
up again and out the other arm.

18:46.798 --> 18:48.800
The stomach detour is critical.

18:49.301 --> 18:52.721
You must not let the lightning
pass through your heart,

18:52.804 --> 18:54.973
for the damage could be deadly.

18:55.766 --> 18:58.852
You may wish to try
a physical motion

18:58.935 --> 19:03.023
to get a feel for the pathway's flow,
like this.

19:07.277 --> 19:09.905
Now, are you focusing your energy?

19:10.238 --> 19:13.450
Can you feel your own chi flowing in,

19:13.533 --> 19:16.495
down, up, and out?

19:16.578 --> 19:17.871
I think so.

19:19.581 --> 19:23.585
Come on. You got to feel the flow.

19:29.299 --> 19:31.510
Excellent. You've got it.

19:31.760 --> 19:34.096
Great. I'm ready
to try it with real lightning.

19:34.805 --> 19:38.475
What? Are you crazy?
Lightning is very dangerous.

19:38.558 --> 19:40.018
I thought that was the point―

19:40.102 --> 19:42.270
You teaching me how
to protect myself from it.

19:42.354 --> 19:45.440
Yeah, but I'm not going to shoot
lightning at you.

19:45.816 --> 19:46.817
If you're lucky,

19:46.900 --> 19:50.153
you will never have to use this
technique at all.

19:52.197 --> 19:54.157
( THUNDER )

19:54.241 --> 19:56.910
Well, if you won't help me,
I'll find my own lightning.

19:58.745 --> 19:59.788
( CALLING )

20:01.331 --> 20:02.416
Hey there.

20:02.999 --> 20:04.251
We found your cub.

20:10.966 --> 20:13.009
See? We have no problem with you.

20:13.552 --> 20:14.594
We're friendly.

20:14.678 --> 20:15.804
( SNORTING )

20:16.346 --> 20:18.640
Aang, this is bad.
You got to get me out of here.

20:19.558 --> 20:20.559
Aah!

20:30.819 --> 20:32.028
This is really bad.

20:32.237 --> 20:34.531
Please, Aang!
You have to earthbend me out.

20:34.614 --> 20:35.991
There's no other way.

20:37.075 --> 20:40.829
Hyah! Hyah!

20:44.583 --> 20:45.584
Oh, no.

20:47.461 --> 20:49.212
Yoo-hoo! Look at me!

20:58.472 --> 21:00.015
Please. Don't leave me again.

21:00.098 --> 21:01.099
I won't.

21:19.117 --> 21:20.327
What are you doing here?

21:20.660 --> 21:21.995
Just enjoying the show.

21:22.078 --> 21:24.498
What? You were there the whole time?

21:24.581 --> 21:25.832
Pretty much.

21:25.916 --> 21:27.292
Why didn't you do something?

21:27.584 --> 21:28.794
Sokka was in trouble.

21:28.877 --> 21:30.128
I was in trouble!

21:30.212 --> 21:32.714
You could have gotten him out
and helped us get away.

21:32.798 --> 21:34.466
I guess it just didn't occur to me.

21:39.763 --> 21:42.599
Enough. I want my staff back.

21:43.725 --> 21:44.726
Do it now.

21:44.893 --> 21:45.894
What?

21:45.977 --> 21:47.437
Earthbend, twinkle toes.

21:47.687 --> 21:50.607
You just stood your ground
against a crazy beast.

21:50.690 --> 21:51.942
And even more impressive,

21:52.025 --> 21:53.819
you stood your ground against me.

21:53.902 --> 21:55.320
You've got the stuff.

21:55.612 --> 21:57.280
- But―
- Do it!

21:58.740 --> 21:59.825
Hyah!

22:00.659 --> 22:01.785
You did it!

22:02.369 --> 22:04.120
You're an earthbender.

22:04.204 --> 22:05.497
I can't believe it.

22:05.580 --> 22:08.959
Aw. This is really a wonderful,
touching moment.

22:09.167 --> 22:10.669
So could you get me out of here

22:10.752 --> 22:13.129
so I can give you both a big snuggly hug?

22:13.547 --> 22:14.798
No problem, Sokka.

22:15.173 --> 22:17.676
Actually, you should probably
let me do that.

22:17.759 --> 22:19.511
You're still a little new to this.

22:19.803 --> 22:21.388
You might accidentally crush him.

22:21.638 --> 22:23.056
Yeah, no crushing, please.

22:30.856 --> 22:32.315
You found him!

22:33.024 --> 22:34.943
The whole time I was in that hole,

22:35.026 --> 22:37.612
not knowing if I would live or die,

22:37.696 --> 22:40.407
it makes a man think
about what's really important.

22:40.490 --> 22:41.658
I realized―

22:41.741 --> 22:43.410
Hey, Katara, look what I can do.

22:46.830 --> 22:48.748
You did it!
I knew you would.

22:49.249 --> 22:51.543
You tried the positive reinforcement,
didn't you?

22:52.085 --> 22:54.379
Yup. It worked wonders.

22:54.754 --> 22:56.131
( GROWLS )

22:56.214 --> 22:59.009
Appa, Appa, I can earthbend now.

22:59.092 --> 23:00.886
The key is being
completely rooted―

23:01.177 --> 23:03.263
Physically and mentally unmovable.

23:03.513 --> 23:05.390
Whoa! Uh!

23:05.974 --> 23:07.350
( LAUGHTER )

23:09.978 --> 23:10.979
( THUNDER )

23:13.607 --> 23:15.859
You've always
thrown everything you could at me.

23:15.942 --> 23:19.070
Well, I can take it.
And now I can give it back!

23:23.491 --> 23:24.492
Come on!

23:25.035 --> 23:26.036
Strike me!

23:26.119 --> 23:28.163
You've never held back before.

23:35.670 --> 23:38.798
( ZUKO YELLS )
